									<p>Hi, I'm a Ph.D student from Colombia currently based in Bern, Switzerland. I'm working on the topic of Visual Question Answering (VQA). I enjoy working with Computer Vision and Natural Language Processing. <br> Currently looking for a summer internship in Computer vision, Deep Learning or NLP.</p>
